#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choosing a data access approach"
msgstr "Elegir un enfoque de acceso a datos"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Yii3 keeps database access in optional packages. A new application doesn't get a global `Yii::$app->db` component\n"
"or a built-in Active Record layer automatically, so choose the package and boundary that fit your application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Yii3 mantiene el acceso a bases de datos en paquetes opcionales. Una aplicación nueva no obtiene automáticamente un componente global `Yii::$app->db`\n"
"ni una capa de Active Record integrada, así que elige el paquete y la frontera que mejor se adapten a tu aplicación.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you used Yii 2.0 database access layer, `yiisoft/db` is the closest Yii3 equivalent. It provides database\n"
"connections, commands, schema support, and a query builder. Instead of calling `Yii::$app->db`, configure a\n"
"connection as a service and inject `ConnectionInterface` where the database is needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si usabas la capa de acceso a bases de datos de Yii 2.0, `yiisoft/db` es el equivalente más cercano en Yii3. Proporciona conexiones\n"
"a bases de datos, comandos, soporte de esquemas y un constructor de consultas. En lugar de llamar a `Yii::$app->db`, configura una\n"
"conexión como servicio e inyecta `ConnectionInterface` donde se necesite la base de datos.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "If you used Yii 2.0 Active Record, you can install `yiisoft/active-record`. It is useful when your model classes mostly describe tables and relations. For applications where Yii 2.0 Active Record classes also contain form validation, request scenarios, authorization checks, or business workflows, move those responsibilities to form models, services, and domain objects instead of putting them back into the record class."
msgstr "Si usabas Active Record de Yii 2.0, puedes instalar `yiisoft/active-record`. Es útil cuando tus clases de modelo se limitan sobre todo a describir tablas y relaciones. En las aplicaciones en las que las clases Active Record de Yii 2.0 también contienen validación de formularios, escenarios de solicitud, comprobaciones de autorización o flujos de negocio, traslada esas responsabilidades a modelos de formulario, servicios y objetos de dominio en lugar de volver a ponerlas en la clase del registro."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "For most application code, put a repository or query service between the action/service layer and storage:"
msgstr "Para la mayor parte del código de la aplicación, pon un repositorio o un servicio de consulta entre la capa de acciones/servicios y el almacenamiento:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "actions and application services depend on repository methods such as `findOneBySlug()`, `findAll()`, `save()`, and `deleteBySlug()`;"
msgstr "las acciones y los servicios de la aplicación dependen de métodos del repositorio como `findOneBySlug()`, `findAll()`, `save()` y `deleteBySlug()`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "the repository hides whether persistence is implemented with `yiisoft/db`, Active Record, Cycle, Doctrine, or another storage;"
msgstr "el repositorio oculta si la persistencia se implementa con `yiisoft/db`, Active Record, Cycle, Doctrine u otro almacenamiento;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "the repository is the place to map raw database rows or records to typed objects used by the rest of the code."
msgstr "el repositorio es el lugar donde se transforman las filas en bruto de la base de datos o los registros en los objetos tipados que usa el resto del código."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Small CRUD applications can start with a concrete repository class. Larger applications usually benefit from a repository interface in the domain or module and an implementation in the infrastructure layer."
msgstr "Las aplicaciones CRUD pequeñas pueden empezar con una clase de repositorio concreta. Las aplicaciones más grandes suelen beneficiarse de una interfaz de repositorio en el dominio o en el módulo y una implementación en la capa de infraestructura."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "In this guide, we will focus on working with relational databases using Yii DB. We'll use PostgreSQL to implement a simple CRUD (create read update delete)."
msgstr "En esta guía nos centraremos en trabajar con bases de datos relacionales mediante Yii DB. Usaremos PostgreSQL para implementar un CRUD sencillo (crear, leer, actualizar y eliminar)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing PostgreSQL"
msgstr "Instalar PostgreSQL"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "You need to install PostgreSQL. If you prefer not to use Docker, [get the installer from official website](https://www.postgresql.org/download/), install it and create a database."
msgstr "Tienes que instalar PostgreSQL. Si prefieres no usar Docker, [descarga el instalador desde la web oficial](https://www.postgresql.org/download/), instálalo y crea una base de datos."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "If you use Docker, it is a bit simpler. Modify `docker/dev/compose.yml`:"
msgstr "Si usas Docker, es algo más sencillo. Modifica `docker/dev/compose.yml`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"services:\n"
"    app:\n"
"        build:\n"
"            dockerfile: docker/Dockerfile\n"
"            context: ..\n"
"            target: dev\n"
"            args:\n"
"                USER_ID: ${UID}\n"
"                GROUP_ID: ${GID}\n"
"        env_file:\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/.env\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/override.env\n"
"                required: false\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_PORT:-80}:80\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../:/app\n"
"            - ../runtime:/app/runtime\n"
"            - caddy_data:/data\n"
"            - caddy_config:/config\n"
"        tty: true\n"
"        depends_on:\n"
"            db:\n"
"                condition: service_healthy\n"
"\n"
"    db:\n"
"        image: postgres:${POSTGRES_VERSION:-18}-alpine\n"
"        environment:\n"
"            POSTGRES_DB: app\n"
"            POSTGRES_PASSWORD: password\n"
"            POSTGRES_USER: user\n"
"            POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS: \"--locale-provider=icu --icu-locale=und --encoding=UTF8\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../runtime/db:/var/lib/postgresql:rw\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_DB_PORT:-5432}:5432\"\n"
"        healthcheck:\n"
"            test: [ \"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U user -d app\" ]\n"
"            interval: 5s\n"
"            timeout: 5s\n"
"            retries: 5\n"
msgstr ""
"services:\n"
"    app:\n"
"        build:\n"
"            dockerfile: docker/Dockerfile\n"
"            context: ..\n"
"            target: dev\n"
"            args:\n"
"                USER_ID: ${UID}\n"
"                GROUP_ID: ${GID}\n"
"        env_file:\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/.env\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/override.env\n"
"                required: false\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_PORT:-80}:80\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../:/app\n"
"            - ../runtime:/app/runtime\n"
"            - caddy_data:/data\n"
"            - caddy_config:/config\n"
"        tty: true\n"
"        depends_on:\n"
"            db:\n"
"                condition: service_healthy\n"
"\n"
"    db:\n"
"        image: postgres:${POSTGRES_VERSION:-18}-alpine\n"
"        environment:\n"
"            POSTGRES_DB: app\n"
"            POSTGRES_PASSWORD: password\n"
"            POSTGRES_USER: user\n"
"            POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS: \"--locale-provider=icu --icu-locale=und --encoding=UTF8\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../runtime/db:/var/lib/postgresql:rw\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_DB_PORT:-5432}:5432\"\n"
"        healthcheck:\n"
"            test: [ \"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U user -d app\" ]\n"
"            interval: 5s\n"
"            timeout: 5s\n"
"            retries: 5\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Note that we add `depends_on` so application waits for database to be up."
msgstr "Ten en cuenta que añadimos `depends_on` para que la aplicación espere a que la base de datos esté en marcha."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n"
"> Also, we'll need a `pdo_pgsql` extension to communicate with PostgreSQL. You can enable it locally in `php.ini`.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n"
"> Además, necesitaremos la extensión `pdo_pgsql` para comunicarnos con PostgreSQL. En local, puedes habilitarla en `php.ini`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "If you use Docker, check `docker/Dockerfile` and add `pdo_pgsql` in `install-php-extensions` list:"
msgstr "Si usas Docker, revisa `docker/Dockerfile` y añade `pdo_pgsql` a la lista de `install-php-extensions`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (dockerfile)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"RUN install-php-extensions \\\n"
"    opcache \\\n"
"    mbstring \\\n"
"    intl \\\n"
"    dom \\\n"
"    ctype \\\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    phar \\\n"
"    openssl \\\n"
"    xml \\\n"
"    xmlwriter \\\n"
"    simplexml \\\n"
"    pdo \\\n"
"    pdo_pgsql\n"
msgstr ""
"RUN install-php-extensions \\\n"
"    opcache \\\n"
"    mbstring \\\n"
"    intl \\\n"
"    dom \\\n"
"    ctype \\\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    phar \\\n"
"    openssl \\\n"
"    xml \\\n"
"    xmlwriter \\\n"
"    simplexml \\\n"
"    pdo \\\n"
"    pdo_pgsql\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Then rebuild PHP image with"
msgstr "Después, vuelve a construir la imagen de PHP con"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "make build && make down && make up\n"
msgstr "make build && make down && make up\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring connection"
msgstr "Configurar la conexión"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Now that we have the database, it's time to define the connection."
msgstr "Ahora que tenemos la base de datos, es hora de definir la conexión."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "First we need a package to be installed:"
msgstr "Primero tenemos que instalar un paquete:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "make composer require yiisoft/db-pgsql:2.*\n"
msgstr "make composer require yiisoft/db-pgsql:2.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Now create `config/common/di/db-pgsql.php`:"
msgstr "Ahora crea `config/common/di/db-pgsql.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['username'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['username'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "And define parameters in `config/common/params.php`. For Docker that would be:"
msgstr "Y define los parámetros en `config/common/params.php`. Con Docker sería:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-pgsql' => [\n"
"        'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"        'username' => 'user',\n"
"        'password' => 'password',\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-pgsql' => [\n"
"        'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"        'username' => 'user',\n"
"        'password' => 'password',\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "`db` host is resolved automatically within the Docker network."
msgstr "El host `db` se resuelve automáticamente dentro de la red de Docker."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "For local installation without Docker the host in Dsn would be `localhost`. You'll have to adjust the rest to match how you configured the database."
msgstr "En una instalación local sin Docker, el host del DSN sería `localhost`. Tendrás que ajustar el resto según cómo hayas configurado la base de datos."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiple database connections"
msgstr "Varias conexiones a bases de datos"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "When the application works with several databases, keep `ConnectionInterface` for the primary connection and add a class alias for each named connection:"
msgstr "Cuando la aplicación trabaja con varias bases de datos, mantén `ConnectionInterface` para la conexión principal y añade un alias de clase para cada conexión con nombre:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Db\\AnalyticsDatabase;\n"
"use App\\Db\\MainDatabase;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, MainDatabase::class);\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, AnalyticsDatabase::class);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => MainDatabase::class,\n"
"\n"
"    MainDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    AnalyticsDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Db\\AnalyticsDatabase;\n"
"use App\\Db\\MainDatabase;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, MainDatabase::class);\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, AnalyticsDatabase::class);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => MainDatabase::class,\n"
"\n"
"    MainDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    AnalyticsDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "The alias class names are used as service IDs and type hints. They don't need PHP files of their own."
msgstr "Los nombres de las clases alias se usan como identificadores de servicio y en las declaraciones de tipo. No necesitan archivos PHP propios."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Define matching parameters:"
msgstr "Define los parámetros correspondientes:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'app/db' => [\n"
"        'main' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'user',\n"
"            'password' => 'password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"        'analytics' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'analytics-db', 'analytics', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'analytics_user',\n"
"            'password' => 'analytics_password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'app/db' => [\n"
"        'main' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'user',\n"
"            'password' => 'password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"        'analytics' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'analytics-db', 'analytics', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'analytics_user',\n"
"            'password' => 'analytics_password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Services that need the primary database can still depend on `ConnectionInterface`. Services that need another database should type-hint the corresponding alias:"
msgstr "Los servicios que necesitan la base de datos principal pueden seguir dependiendo de `ConnectionInterface`. Los servicios que necesitan otra base de datos deben declarar como tipo el alias correspondiente:"

